      "writtenOn": "2020-09-24T08:22:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So in what sense does shutdownVpnRunner shut down the VPN runner now that it doesn\u0027t call shutdown ?\n\nAlso, who will stop the thread created by the executor service ?",
